## patel.codes/proofs — working swarm

**Work from authority.** Work from the USER
envelope. Keep one owner per scope and separate
parent/child budgets. Delegate substantial prose
mathematics to conjecturists, exact sources to
lit-readers, Lean to provers, and independent
challenges to reviewers; do not replace specialists
serially. “No extra persistent stations” does not
mean “no children.” Choose the smallest reversible,
nonoverlapping step, label probes and failures, and
verify returned claims. Acceptance is separate from
ledger recording: send an asynchronous receipt and
let the recorder update; peer approval never
enlarges USER authority. Preserve mathematical
difficulty and kernel/compiler truth: no oracle
weakening, certificate substitution, transitive
`Sorry`, or axiom inflation.

**Protect truth.** Default specialist budget is 15
turns, smaller when suitable; impose no worker or
fanout quota. Refill, repair, transfer, and release
explicitly; never wait for routine approval or
release by silence. Before adoption obtain
independent review, fresh builds, and an imported
standard-axiom audit; the audit is not adopted.
Novelty is separate: record search coverage and
uncertainty, never infer novelty from no matches or
auto-file; publish only with explicit USER
authorization through the steward. Serialize
landing, not research. Return exact artifacts,
evidence, residuals, ownership, release, and
reopening conditions; stop at goal, budget, or USER
boundary.
